112	Color isn't about "what looks nice" — it's about what the design FEELS.
113	
114	**Building a Palette**:
115	
116	```css
117	/* Dark, Confident, Premium */
118	:root {
119	  --bg-primary: #0a0a0a;
120	  --bg-secondary: #171717;
121	  --bg-tertiary: #262626;
122	  --text-primary: #fafafa;
123	  --text-secondary: #a3a3a3;
124	  --accent: #22c55e;  /* Confident green */
125	  --accent-subtle: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
126	}
127	
128	/* Light, Warm, Approachable */
129	:root {
130	  --bg-primary: #fffbf5;
131	  --bg-secondary: #fff7ed;
132	  --bg-tertiary: #ffedd5;
133	  --text-primary: #1c1917;
134	  --text-secondary: #78716c;
135	  --accent: #ea580c;  /* Warm orange */
136	  --accent-subtle: rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.1);
137	}
138	
139	/* High Contrast, Editorial */
140	:root {
141	  --bg-primary: #ffffff;
142	  --bg-secondary: #f5f5f5;
143	  --text-primary: #000000;
144	  --text-secondary: #525252;
145	  --accent: #dc2626;  /* Bold red */
146	  --accent-subtle: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.05);
147	}
148	```
149	
150	**The 60-30-10 Rule**:
151	- 60% dominant (background)
152	- 30% secondary (cards, sections)
153	- 10% accent (CTAs, highlights)
154	
155	### Motion as Narrative
156	
157	Animation tells a story. What's your story?
158	
159	**Page Load Orchestration**:
160	```css
161	/* Hero elements enter in sequence */
162	.hero-badge {
163	  animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.1s both;
164	}
165	.hero-title {
166	  animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.2s both;
167	}
168	.hero-subtitle {
169	  animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.3s both;
170	}
171	.hero-cta {
172	  animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.4s both;
173	}
174	
175	@keyframes fadeSlideUp {
176	  from {
177	    opacity: 0;
178	    transform: translateY(20px);
179	  }
180	  to {
181	    opacity: 1;
182	    transform: translateY(0);
183	  }
184	}
185	```
186	
187	**Scroll-Triggered Reveals**:
188	```javascript
189	// Intersection Observer for scroll animations
190	const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
191	  entries.forEach(entry => {
192	    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
193	      entry.target.classList.add('animate-in');
194	    }
195	  });
196	}, { threshold: 0.1 });
197	
198	document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
199	```
200	
201	**Hover States That Surprise**:
202	```css
203	.card {
204	  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
205	}
206	
207	.card:hover {
208	  transform: translateY(-4px);
209	  box-shadow: 
210	    0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
211	    0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
212	}
213	
214	/* Or more dramatic */
215	.card:hover {
216	  transform: scale(1.02) rotate(-0.5deg);
217	}
218	```
219	
220	### Backgrounds as Atmosphere
221	
222	The background sets the mood before any content is read.
223	
224	**Gradient Mesh**:
225	```css
226	.gradient-mesh {
227	  background: 
228	    radial-gradient(at 40% 20%, hsla(28, 100%, 74%, 0.3) 0px, transparent 50%),
229	    radial-gradient(at 80% 0%, hsla(189, 100%, 56%, 0.2) 0px, transparent 50%),
230	    radial-gradient(at 0% 50%, hsla(355, 100%, 93%, 0.3) 0px, transparent 50%),
231	    radial-gradient(at 80% 50%, hsla(340, 100%, 76%, 0.2) 0px, transparent 50%),
232	    radial-gradient(at 0% 100%, hsla(269, 100%, 77%, 0.3) 0px, transparent 50%);
233	}
234	```
235	
236	**Noise Texture**:
237	```css
238	.noise::before {
239	  content: '';
240	  position: fixed;
241	  top: 0;
242	  left: 0;
243	  width: 100%;
244	  height: 100%;
245	  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 400 400' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
246	  opacity: 0.03;
247	  pointer-events: none;
248	  z-index: 1000;
249	}
250	```
251	
252	**Dot Pattern**:
253	```css
254	.dots {
255	  background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #333 1px, transparent 1px);
256	  background-size: 20px 20px;
257	}
258	```
259	
260	**Glassmorphism**:
261	```css
262	.glass {
263	  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
264	  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
265	  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
266	  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
267	}
268	```
269	
270	---
271	
272	## Design Decision Framework
273	
274	When stuck, ask these questions:
275	
276	1. **What's the ONE thing?** — If users remember one element, what is it?
277	2. **Would I screenshot this?** — Is there a moment worth sharing?
278	3. **Does it feel designed?** — Or does it feel generated?
279	4. **What's the emotion?** — Confident? Playful? Serious? Luxurious?
280	5. **Is it brave?** — Did I play it safe or commit to a direction?
281	
282	---
283	
284	## Anti-Pattern Detection
285	
286	Before shipping, scan for these:
287	
288	| Anti-Pattern | Fix |
289	|--------------|-----|
290	| Inter font | Replace with distinctive alternative |
291	| Purple gradient | Choose contextual palette |
292	| All centered | Add asymmetry or left-align |
293	| No animations | Add orchestrated page load |
294	| Solid background | Add texture, gradient, or pattern |
295	| Evenly spaced colors | Apply 60-30-10 rule |
296	| Generic cards | Add unique styling treatment |
297	| Default shadows | Use layered, atmospheric shadows |
298	
299	---
300	
301	*Remember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don't hold back.*
302

